[^3]: Meghana Indukuri, Eman Naseerkhan, Joshua Rose, Martin Tran, Younghee Park, *Designing CAPTCHA Systems with Reinforcement Learning for Adaptive Defense*, 2026, https://www.mdpi.com/2079-9292/15/11/2363, il 19 agosto 2026.
